//     Two data slots: id 1 program ROM (bridge 0x1000_0000, 2 MB), id 2 tile ROM (0x2000_0000, 4 MB), SP: id 3 sprite ROM (0x3000_0000, 16 MB), rel: id 7 sound ROM (0x7000_0000, 4 MB); their sizes come
